{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to bonk penguins in style <i>and</i> support the devs at the same time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126460/extras/8fc3a5f0a5bab8a64552cd61b4a2fe9e.poster.avif?t=1761584210\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126460/extras/8fc3a5f0a5bab8a64552cd61b4a2fe9e.webm?t=1761584210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126460/extras/8fc3a5f0a5bab8a64552cd61b4a2fe9e.mp4?t=1761584210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the <strong>JoyBits Supporter Bat</strong>\u00a0- a shiny new addition to your collection and a heartfelt \u201cthank you\u201d from the team behind Bouncemasters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc27 Supporter Bat DLC\u00a0Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exclusive hammer-style\u00a0<strong>JoyBits Bat</strong>\u00a0- available only to Supporter Bat DLC owners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small but heartfelt way to support our studio \u2764\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When we released <strong>Bouncemasters</strong> on Steam, it was 100% free - no ads, no microtransactions, no tricks. We didn\u2019t plan to earn anything - it was just a small gift to our community. But many of you asked for a way to thank or support us, so we added something special: the <strong>JoyBits Bat</strong>! It\u2019s not overpowered and not useless \u2014 just a fun, balanced way to show your support and keep the penguins flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being with us \u2764\ufe0f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac